  159 060215             ! ============================================================
  160 060215             ! INIT -- OPTION-ROM workspace lifecycle
  161 060215             !
  162 060215             ! ROMFL=0 (power-on): reserve permanent writable RAM, publish its base in
  163 060215             ! BAS241, call SCRAT+ as documented by HP, then clear the entire workspace.
  164 060215             !
  165 060215             ! ROMFL=1 (RESET): SYSIN+ resets CHIDLE to RTN.  Preserve the stored printer
  166 060215             ! profile but clear KHACT so a later PRTKEYS 1 can install the hook again.
  167 060215             !
  168 060215             ! Other ROMINI reasons do not change PRINTER85 state.  In particular, LOAD,
  169 060215             ! SCRATCH, STOP and PAUSE do not remove an Option ROM or its private RAM.
  170 060215             ! ============================================================
  171 060215             
  172 060215 230         INIT    BIN
