  367 060611             ! ============================================================
  368 060611             ! PRTKEYS RUNTIME -- keyboard takeover and native key-label panel
  369 060611             !
  370 060611             !       PRTKEYS 1    install PRINTER85 COPY/PAPER/K1..K8 CHIDLE hook
  371 060611             !       PRTKEYS 0    restore saved CHIDLE bytes and native key labels
  372 060611             !
  373 060611             ! PRTKEYS does not choose a printer.  Configure the independent keyboard
  374 060611             ! hardcopy profile first with PRTSET.  If no valid PRTSET profile exists,
  375 060611             ! COPY/PAPER and the six setting keys are consumed but do not change/send a
  376 060611             ! printer setting; K4/K8 remain panel navigation controls.
  377 060611             !
  378 060611             ! Keys outside COPY/PAPER/K1..K8 remain under normal HP-85 handling.
