  633 061346             ! ============================================================
  634 061346             ! COMMON TEXT / COPY PROFILE UTILITIES -- v0.03b RC1
  635 061346             !
  636 061346             ! All numeric commands accept full BASIC numeric expressions because they
  637 061346             ! reuse the same NUMVP parser as PRTKEYS.  The runtime converts the evaluated
  638 061346             ! REAL to a 16-bit integer before validating the public value.
  639 061346             !
  640 061346             !       PRTPITCH  0..3
Page   11                                                             
