  641 061346             !           0 normal             ThinkJet 12.0 cpi
  642 061346             !           1 expanded           ThinkJet  6.0 cpi
  643 061346             !           2 compressed         ThinkJet 21.3 cpi
  644 061346             !           3 expanded-compr.    ThinkJet 10.7 cpi
  645 061346             !
  646 061346             !       PRTLPI    6 | 8
  647 061346             !       PRTBOLD   0 | 1
  648 061346             !       PRTUNDER  0 | 1
  649 061346             !       PRTNORM               normal pitch, 6 LPI, bold/underline off
  650 061346             !       PRTZOOM   1 | 2 | 4  (4 only for ThinkJet)
  651 061346             !       PRTORIENT 0 | 1      (portrait / clockwise landscape)
  652 061346             !
  653 061346             ! Text-style commands require a valid PRTSET profile because they immediately
  654 061346             ! send the corresponding control sequence to that configured printer.
