 1959 065101             ! ============================================================
 1960 065101             ! TABLE-DRIVEN PRINTER DRIVER CORE -- v0.03b
 1961 065101             !
 1962 065101             ! Driver descriptors are registered in DRVTAB.  Core code never branches on a
 1963 065101             ! concrete printer number for text controls, paper controls or hardcopy driver
 1964 065101             ! entry.  The descriptor layout and copy/paste template are near LOCAL DATA.
 1965 065101             !
 1966 065101             ! DRVGET is the only routine that knows DRVTAB is an array of two-byte DEFs.
