 3439 071346             ! Input:
 3440 071346             !       R30/R31 = source byte count (24 or 32)
 3441 071346             !       R32/R33 = absolute source pointer
 3442 071346             ! Output:
 3443 071346             !       TJSBUF contains 2*count bytes.
 3444 071346             !
 3445 071346             ! Each nibble is expanded through DUP4, where every source bit becomes
 3446 071346             ! two adjacent output bits.  High nibble is emitted before low nibble.
